        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "One reason for avoiding metatables was for performance. I wouldn't expect __newindex to affect performance but I also won't assume it doesn't. So this needs [benchmarks](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/38561#issuecomment-4326214346). Would also increase confidence if this PR referenced the relevant previous discussions.\r\n\r\nCertainly `validate` is a cost (small but real for hot loops), so for internal usage we should continue to avoid this path. Especially for treesitter.\r\n",
            "created_at": "2026-08-18T11:28:34Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41318#issuecomment-5327507896",
            "id": 5327507896,
